## Answer Requirements

- Formal Japanese business/compliance style.
- Structure: (1) direct answer, (2) regulatory basis with citations,
  (3) practical compliance steps, (4) caveats / when to consult a professional.
- If passage_count is 0: state that no grounded source was found and decline to
  answer beyond a referral to a qualified professional.
